# setuptools' default sdist rules pick up tests/ but not the extension-less xored corpora the
# suite reads, so the published sdist carried 1.6 MB of a test suite that could not run from it
# -- and those corpora are live malware, which is not something to publish to an index either.
# The sdist carries src/ and the packaging metadata; clone the repository to run the tests.
prune tests
